      "text": "Qwen3.5 sharded full-attention KV: absolute-position ownership\n\nowner = (prefix_length + new_token_index) % CP\nExample: prefix_length = 5, new_token_index = 0 -> owner rank 1\nQuery layout can change; this KV ownership rule stays the same.",
